  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>12</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>12</mn><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Assume,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>12</mn><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Clearly,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So, here&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;increasing and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>and clearly&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is decreasing function because it is reciprocal function.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0115_e161ea22cfba.png\" style=\"width: 247px; height: 240px;\" /></p><p>From the graph, we can say that&nbsp;number&nbsp;of real roots&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>"
